- The left-sidebar "Plugins" icon reproduces the DSH pinwheel path from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives` (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek); the toast layout follows DSH's own toast. See [NOTICE](./NOTICE).
